{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 127 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Cisplatin is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; FDA's history shows an earlier shortage first posted on 2023-02-10, since resolved.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1207607 at Thymoorgan Pharmazie Gmbh ended 2022-10-06 and was classified VAI, 127 days before FDA posted the shortage on 2023-02-10.",
      "cites": ["D5", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later FDA inspection 1203954 at the same plant ended 2023-04-25 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2023-07-10, 74 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The plant is a registered manufacturer for a Hikma-labeled cisplatin product (NDC 00143950401).",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory at Corvale East provides 16.1 days on hand for the 50 mg/50 mL presentation and 18.7 days for the 1 mg/mL presentation.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 30.9 days on hand for the 50 mg/50 mL presentation and 31 days for the 1 mg/mL presentation.",
      "cites": ["D2", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose plant was last inspected VAI on 2023-08-24.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    }
  ]
}
